              "expr": "(sum by(instance) (irate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"node\", mode!=\"idle\"}[1m])) / on(instance) group_left sum by (instance)((irate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"node\"}[1m]))))",
